  "text": "- Home\n- /Products\nCatalog\n\n# Products\nTicNote recorders and earbuds, plus AR glasses sold by CNPS.AI. Every Buy link opens the matching handle on shop.cnps.ai.\n\n\n## TicNote lineup\nCompare TicNote AI voice recorders and note-taking earbuds for meetings, calls, lectures and everyday ideas. Choose card, Lite, WiFi or 4G models and eligible Pro-plan bundles.\n\n\n\n\n### TicNote AI Voice RecorderSale\nA card-sized recorder for meetings, lectures, and calls. Transcripts and summaries in the TicNote app.\n$179.99 From $139.99 USD\nBuyDetails\n\n\n\n### TicNote LiteSale\nA lighter TicNote recorder for meetings and lectures. Transcripts and summaries in the app.\n$129.99 From $99.99 USD\nBuyDetails\n\n\n\n### TicNote Pods WiFiSale\nOpen-ear earbuds that record and transcribe on the go. Notes land in the TicNote app.\n$249.99 From $219.99 USD\nBuyDetails\n\n\n\n### TicNote Pods 4GSale\nOpen-ear 4G earbuds that record and transcribe without Wi-Fi. Notes land in the TicNote app.\n$299.99 From $239.99 USD\nBuyDetails\n\n## AR glasses\nLive shop listings from vendor CNPS.AI. These are not on the shop homepage TicNote lineup.\n\n\n\n\n### AR Smart GlassesSale\nWear the screen instead of holding it. These augmented-reality glasses project a crisp digital display directly into your line of sight using diffractive optical lenses, so information floats in front of you while the world stays clearly visible behind it.\n$1,599.00 $1,299.00 USD\nBuyDetails\n\n\n\n### INMO GO3\n53g MicroLED AR glasses with AI translator, hot-swap battery, and camera.\n$699.00 USD\nBuyDetails",
